@startuml
title the residual window, a redelivery absorbed by the ledger
participant "Broker" as B
participant "TransferRequestListener" as L
participant "PostgreSQL" as D
participant "Transaction coordinator" as C

L -> D : commit the JTA transaction
D --> L : the transfer row and the ledger row are durable
note over L : the process terminates here, while the\nKafka transaction remains undecided
C -> C : abort the undecided transaction
C -> C : leave the consumed offset uncommitted
B -> L : deliver the same request after the restart
L -> D : consult the PROCESSED_REQUESTS ledger
D --> L : the request identifier is already recorded
L -> C : commit the Kafka transaction, applying no further change
@enduml
